+# Audit: drag to adjust (0.22.0)
+
+Date: 2026-11-03 · PR: Cochilo 0.27.0 · Auditor: Claude (graphic-design-fundamentals + impeccable)
+
+## Scope
+
+A behaviour on Cochilo's vertical timeline row; uses existing roles (`selected`, `on-selected`)
+and motion (`animatedColor`). No tokens.
+
+## graphic-design-fundamentals (§13 checklist)
+
+| # | Question | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Brief | Pass: fix a late "woke up" in one move |
+| 2 | Concept | Pass: the bar is the sleep; stretch it |
+| 3 | Hierarchy | Pass: the held row lifts by colour, the new end reads first |
+| 4 | Contrast | Pass: on-selected on selected passes in all themes (already listed) |
+| 5 | Alignment and grid | Pass: the row keeps its rail and columns |
+| 6 | Spacing | Pass |
+| 7 | Typography | Pass: meta role, live |
+| 8 | Colour | Pass: blush for "held", never teal (teal stays the one action) |
+| 9 | Consistency | Pass: same Undo as every other quick change |
+| 10 | Simplicity | Pass: the end only; the start has the Earlier chips |
+| 11 | Real-size test | Pass: Cochilo's `day_dragging_a_sleep_light` |
+| 12 | Accessibility and ergonomics | Pass: custom actions for TalkBack; haptic per step |
+| 13 | Production | Pass: pure rules unit-tested in Cochilo (`AdjustTest`) |
+
+## impeccable (audit)
+
+| # | Dimension | Score | Key finding |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| 1 | Accessibility | 4 | Actions instead of a gesture for TalkBack |
+| 2 | Performance | 4 | — |
+| 3 | Appearance & theming | 4 | Roles only |
+| 4 | Platform conformance | 4 | Long-press then drag, as Android lists do |
+| 5 | Adaptivity | 4 | — |
+| | **Total** | **20/20** | |
